jaiabot-offline-base-map carries 1:10m vector layers from Natural Earth
(https://www.naturalearthdata.com), downloaded from
https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector at the version that
scripts/common-versions.env pins, and land and coastline layers derived from them.
Natural Earth is in the public domain.

